From 7d1da0c9e2b2d2b6c8c3aa3da1d79c1a3059e3c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: muhiddinov <muhiddinovabulqosim@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:16:59 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] orangepi_zero3: auto-generate kernel boot logo from myqtapp's
 PNG

board/orangepi/orangepi-zero3/gen-kernel-logo.py + a
LINUX_POST_RSYNC_HOOKS entry in local.mk regenerate
drivers/video/logo/logo_linux_clut224.ppm from
br2-external/package/myqtapp/src/assets/payzone-logo.png on every
build, so the kernel boot logo and the userspace splash always match
without hand-editing/committing a .ppm in the kernel tree. Also
shrunk the canvas 20% (1920x1000 -> 1536x800), and the logo canvas
background is now black to match myqtapp's splash screen.

Swapped the bundled default video (rootfs-overlay/root/myvideo.mp4)
to a new source file.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
